    "title": "Portage Lake Lift Bridge crossing opens for snowmobile traffic - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lily Simmons ,\n1 days ago HOUGHTON, Mich. (WZMQ) – The Keweenaw Snowmobile Club has officially opened the Portage Lake Lift Bridge crossing for snowmobile traffic for the 2025 – 2026 riding season. The crossing utilizes the lower deck of the world’s largest and heaviest double-decker lift bridge, reconnecting snowmobile routes between Houghton and Hancock and restoring a critical link in the Keweenaw’s trail network. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
